    {
      "title": "Guardian reporter filmed masked militants seconds before West Bank attack on French mayor",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/18/guardian-reporter-filmed-masked-militants-seconds-before-west-bank-attack-on-french-mayor",
      "description": "<p>New video footage of Israeli settler assault on European delegation as Netanyahu attempts to raise doubt</p><p>Hours after Israeli militants <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/17/israeli-settlers-attack-european-diplomats-in-west-bank\">attacked a delegation</a> of European diplomats, French clerics and a visiting mayor in the occupied West Bank, Israel’s leader, Benjamin Netanyahu, responded by questioning the delegation’s account of the assault.</p><p>“Serious accusations require serious evidence” was the all-caps headline of a social media <a href=\"https://x.com/IsraeliPM/status/2111497338808140140?s=20\">post </a>from the office of the prime minister. As news of the attack spread globally there was no pledge to find those accountable and bring them to justice.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/18/guardian-reporter-filmed-masked-militants-seconds-before-west-bank-attack-on-french-mayor\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-18T18:39:23"
    },
    {
      "title": "US ambassador to Israel calls West Bank settler attack on American photojournalist ‘terror’",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/18/us-ambassador-israel-mike-huckabee-west-bank-settler-attack-photojournalist-heidi-levine",
      "description": "<p>Mike Huckabee calls for arrest and prosecution of those responsible as Heidi Levine, 63, recovers in hospital in Israel</p><p>The US ambassador to Israel, Mike Huckabee, has denounced the settler attack that left the Washington Post photojournalist Heidi Levine badly beaten and needing surgery as a “despicable act of terror” and called for the arrest and prosecution of those responsible.</p><p>Levine, 63, an award-winning journalist who lives in Israel, was <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/16/israeli-settlers-attack-olive-farmers-west-bank-washington-post-journalist-heidi-levine\">set upon last Friday</a> by masked Israeli settlers who used clubs and other weapons to attack Palestinian people attempting to harvest their olives in occupied <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/west-bank\">West Bank</a> towns.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/18/us-ambassador-israel-mike-huckabee-west-bank-settler-attack-photojournalist-heidi-levine\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-18T17:02:13"
    },
